(text "C64 PSU GUARD - protected 5 V / 12 V feed for a 1541-II / 1581 drive from a PC power supply.\nv0.2 2026-10-26: J1 PSU in = JST XH B4B-XH-A, keyed (1 +5V, 2/3 GND, 4 +12V; Berg <-> XH adapter cable)\n->  J2 drive out (DIN pin 1 = 5V, 2 = GND, 4 = 12V).\nChannel 5 V: limit 1.2 A, OVP 6.0 V, UVLO 4.2 V.  Channel 12 V: limit 1.5 A, OVP 14.0 V, UVLO 10.4 V.\nTPS25921A = auto retry: red LED on while the channel is off (thermal shutdown), off again when the fault is gone.\nJ3 UFI link = JST XH B4B-XH-A, 1:1 XH cable to UFI J20 GUARD: 1 GND, 2 OFF (high = both channels off), 3 ERR5, 4 ERR12." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e59edd89-5365-57e8-bf1e-eafa83bc2084"))
