(text "UFI link: OFF high = both channels off. ERR5/ERR12 = open drain, released (high) when the\nchannel reports a fault or the guard is unpowered, pulled low while the channel is on.\nUFI Headless v1.0 J20 GUARD (1:1 XH cable): 1 GND, 2 OFF <- PG7 (220R), 3 ERR5 -> PG8, 4 ERR12 -> PC9\n(10k pull-ups to 3.3 V, 220R series resistors and PESD3V3L1BA on the UFI side)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 230 200 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "199f28ef-ad64-58b0-8296-bb2f167eb0ff"))
